 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【郑钦文美网绝境翻盘】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/other/2026-09-06/match2286598vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">绝境逆转！郑钦文决胜盘0-5落后连扳7局 史诗级翻盘晋级美网16强</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260906/6a9c5d15ec4a5.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260906/6a9c5d15ec4a5.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260906/6a9c5d15ec4a5.jpg"> </div><p>美网2026女单第三轮，郑钦文在决胜盘0-5之后连赢七局，最终以1-6 7-6(3) 7-5逆转22号种子凯斯，连赢四场三盘大战，携六连胜第三次跻身美网16强。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/other/2026-09-06/6a9c53d52dadfnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">封神！郑钦文收获280积分和49万美元奖金，即时世界排名升至第80</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260829/6a922b427f3e7.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260829/6a922b427f3e7_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260829/6a922b427f3e7_720.jpg"> </div><p>凭借本场比赛胜利，郑钦文本届美网收获280个积分（40分来自资格赛），49万美元奖金，实时排名世界第80。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/other/2026-09-06/6a9c56080485enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">郑钦文：手术后日子并不轻松，这五个月是我职业生涯最黑暗的时期</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/other/2026-09-06/6a9c620dca593native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">逆转！郑钦文：0-5落后时心里想总不能让她6-0吧，感觉这太丢人了</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.59" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260906/202609060153242301_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.59" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.59" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260906/202609060153242301_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260906/202609060153242301_720.jpg"> </div><p>美网2026女单第三轮，郑钦文在决胜盘0-5之后连赢七局，逆转凯斯晋级美网16强赛后，郑钦文接受了采访。</p><p><strong>【比赛战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-05/match2067673date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">3连胜！曼城1-0考文垂 哈兰德连场破门恩佐首秀策动塞梅尼奥助攻</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.72" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260905/zhanbao_image_2067673_1788622700_gray.jpeg" da