: 100%;" data-ratio="0.68" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260906/zhanbao_image_2076769_1788632976_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260906/zhanbao_image_2076769_1788632976_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>迪亚斯三失单刀，穆西亚拉回归替补登场；拜仁新赛季开局1胜1平，沙尔克2轮不胜。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-05/match2076763date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">多特让二追三客胜霍村 迎德甲两连胜 吉拉西传射恩瓦内里造乌龙</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.67" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260905/zhanbao_image_2076763_1788621822_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.67" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.67" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260905/zhanbao_image_2076763_1788621822_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260905/zhanbao_image_2076763_1788621822_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>恩瓦内里首秀第86分钟造乌龙绝杀，吉拉西5分钟传射，法比奥·席尔瓦替补建功，多特德甲开季两连胜。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-06/match2057411date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">让二追三！国米3-2逆转那不勒斯 劳塔罗双响+绝杀图拉姆破门+中柱</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.67" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260906/zhanbao_image_2057411_1788630847_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200